{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type AnyPreactFormApi = AnyFormApi & PreactTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formApiTypes.public.ts#L50","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formApiTypes.public.ts:50"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A Preact form API whose form data and error types are erased."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use it for reusable Preact components that only need core form operations\nand the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Field"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ArrayField"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Subscribe"},{"type":"text","value":", or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormGroup"},{"type":"text","value":" components common\nto every Preact form. Field paths and values are not checked against a\nparticular form shape; use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"PreactFormType"},{"type":"text","value":" when a component depends on one\nknown form."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function FormSubmitButton({ form }: { form: AnyPreactFormApi }) {\n  return (\n    <form.Subscribe selector={(state) => state.isSubmitting}>\n      {(isSubmitting) => (\n        <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isSubmitting}>\n          {isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n        </button>\n      )}\n    </form.Subscribe>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype AnyPreactFormApi = AnyFormApi & PreactTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formApiTypes.public.ts:50](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formApiTypes.public.ts#L50)\n\nA Preact form API whose form data and error types are erased.\n\nUse it for reusable Preact components that only need core form operations\nand the `Field`, `ArrayField`, `Subscribe`, or `FormGroup` components common\nto every Preact form. Field paths and values are not checked against a\nparticular form shape; use `PreactFormType` when a component depends on one\nknown form.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction FormSubmitButton({ form }: { form: AnyPreactFormApi }) {\n  return (\n    <form.Subscribe selector={(state) => state.isSubmitting}>\n      {(isSubmitting) => (\n        <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isSubmitting}>\n          {isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n        </button>\n      )}\n    </form.Subscribe>\n  )\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AnyPreactFormApi\ntitle: AnyPreactFormApi\n---\n\n```ts\ntype AnyPreactFormApi = AnyFormApi & PreactTanStackFormComponents<any, any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formApiTypes.public.ts:50](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/preact-form/src/PreactForm/formApiTypes.public.ts#L50)\n\nA Preact form API whose form data and error types are erased.\n\nUse it for reusable Preact components that only need core form operations\nand the `Field`, `ArrayField`, `Subscribe`, or `FormGroup` components common\nto every Preact form. Field paths and values are not checked against a\nparticular form shape; use `PreactFormType` when a component depends on one\nknown form.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nfunction FormSubmitButton({ form }: { form: AnyPreactFormApi }) {\n  return (\n    <form.Subscribe selector={(state) => state.isSubmitting}>\n      {(isSubmitting) => (\n        <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isSubmitting}>\n          {isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n        </button>\n      )}\n    </form.Subscribe>\n  )\n}\n```\n"}
